# =====================================================================
# PUBHLT 0411 — Python half
# Public repo: teaching content only.
# Planning documents, the syllabus, and authoring references stay local.
# =====================================================================

# --- NOT PUBLISHED: planning and internal documents ---
HANDOFF_*.md
PREPUBLISH_CHECKLIST.md
shared/
*.docx
~$*.docx
github-pages-setup.txt

# --- NOT PUBLISHED: local tooling config ---
.claude/

# --- The student Python environment ---
# .venv is per-machine and must never be committed.
# student/uv.lock MUST be committed — it is what pins every student to
# identical package versions. It is listed here only to say: do not add it.
.venv/
__pycache__/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# --- Build outputs ---
# student/ is the source of the distribution and IS tracked. The zip built
# from it is not — rebuild with the command in student/README_INSTRUCTOR.md.
pubhlt0411.zip
# student/data/ is a COPY of the root data/ made at packaging time.
student/data/

# --- NOT PUBLISHED: superseded drafts of the landing page ---
index_backup_*.qmd

# --- NOT PUBLISHED: per-module build documentation ---
# Instructor-facing: file manifests, render commands, design rationale,
# verification notes. Students reach modules only through index.qmd.
module*/README.md

# --- NOT PUBLISHED: authoring references and superseded work ---
py4e-master/
archive_v1/
pkgcheck/
tools/
scratchpad_contrast.py
quarto-live-python-demo*
workshop1.qmd
pitt-beamer-header.tex
archive_notebook_homework_2026-08-17/

# --- Build artifacts (regenerated by `quarto render`) ---
.quarto/
_site/
site_libs/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# --- OS / editor cruft ---
.DS_Store
*.swp
.ipynb_checkpoints/
